        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Toni Kukoč, John Starks, Jerry Reinsdorf\n- Organizations: Chicago Bulls, Philadelphia 76ers, Golden State Warriors\n- Roles: Special Advisor, owner\n- Events: three-team trade, 1999–2000 Chicago Bulls season\n\nFacts:\n- Toni Kukoč was born on September 18, 1968.\n- During the 1999–2000 Chicago Bulls season at midseason, Toni Kukoč was traded from the Chicago Bulls to the Philadelphia 76ers in a three-team trade.\n- During that same three-team trade, the Chicago Bulls acquired John Starks from the Golden State Warriors.\n- Toni Kukoč is a Croatian retired professional basketball player.\n- Toni Kukoč is currently Special Advisor to Jerry Reinsdorf.\n- Jerry Reinsdorf is the owner of the Chicago Bulls.",
